Measured concurrency (16 cache keys, per-key limiter off, 100 calls per level, Balanced power plan, on AC):
   2 workers:   94.6 calls per minute, latency p50 1.019 s, p95 1.436 s, max 3.148 s, hit ratio excluding first calls 0.852, errors 0
   5 workers:  234.2 calls per minute, latency p50 1.004 s, p95 1.22 s, max 2.043 s, hit ratio excluding first calls 0.8419, errors 0
